VERIFIED="2026-10-17 live on KodeKloud 339712991953: break made roles platform-lab-drill72-ci and -migrator (MaxSessionDuration 3600, trust lab user + ci role); migrate.sh failed with ValidationError ... exceeds the MaxSessionDuration set for this role; check refused it. iam:UpdateRole and UpdateAssumeRolePolicy are SCP-denied here, so the role is recreated to change it. Wrong path (43200 + widened trust, still chained): raising the limit only moved the error to 'exceeds the 1 hour session limit for roles assumed by role chaining'; with VIA_CI=no check.sh gave PENALTY 25+30, and a script using the user's keys PENALTY 20. Proper fixes both scored 100: (A) recreate migrator at 7200 + VIA_CI=no, (B) SESSION_SECONDS=3600 + REFRESH_EVERY=3000 through the chain. reset deleted both roles and the workspace"
